{"id":"n70797-1-3","stage":4,"title":"자네 · 你","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70797-1-3-1","ko":"자네 나이가 올해 몇인가?","zh":"你今年多大了？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"자네","meaning":"你","explanation":"자네：你","readings":[{"term":"자네","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70797","senseId":"1","lemma":"자네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나이가","meaning":"年龄，年纪，岁数","explanation":"나이：年龄，年纪，岁数；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나이","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60486","senseId":"1","lemma":"나이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"올해","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올해：今年","readings":[{"term":"올해","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67842","senseId":"1","lemma":"올해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇인가?","meaning":"几，多少","explanation":"몇：几，多少；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；ㄴ가：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"2","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"aa7a1b1564db7cda","term":"자네","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/aa7a1b1564db7cda8172.mp3","entryId":"70797","definition":"(敬语)听者为朋友或晚辈时用来指称听者。","pronunciation":["자네"]},{"id":"9584bdb8265fdb6c","term":"나이","zh":"年龄，年纪，岁数","audio":"/audio/9584bdb8265fdb6c76c7.mp3","entryId":"60486","definition":"人或动植物等来到世上生存至今的年数。","pronunciation":["나이"]},{"id":"8a0cd9bb73fb17e9","term":"올해","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/8a0cd9bb73fb17e933c6.mp3","entryId":"67842","definition":"现在正在度过的这一年。","pronunciation":["올해"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几，多少","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"用于询问不知道的数目。","pronunciation":["멷"]}],"audio":"/audio/294f652753400ac6610d.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70797-1-3-2","ko":"올해로 서른입니다, 어르신.","zh":"我今年三十岁，长辈。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올해로",